{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：15:05 2026-11-25 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/0aadaab3e3dba5a6560591c7b3b70ec8/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-25_at_15_26_48.jpeg\"/>\n<p>大埔富善邨善美樓，今（25日）中午1時46分，一名84歲姓葉男子報案稱，遭匪徒尾隨上樓入屋襲擊，其間劫走他的手機、內有2萬元現金的銀包，並搶去共值67萬元金飾，包括2條金鏈、3隻金手鈪及2隻金戒指，糾纏間事主被打傷頭，匪徒得手後逃之夭夭。救援人員接報到場，發現事主頭部流血、面及鼻腫，四肢擦傷，將他送往大埔那打素醫院治理，</p>\n<p>警方將案件暫列作「行劫」，交由大埔警區重案組跟進，正追緝一名年約30歲涉案男賊。據街坊稱，遇劫事主在邨內頗出名，綽號「上海仔」，經常戴著粗金鏈，自稱袋住10多萬現金，不時攤在邨內的乒乓波枱上睡覺。</p>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5b626f71c8af5aa6e21e9cc80712e60f/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-25_at_15_27_38.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"探員到善美樓調查。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ff88720d3fe5c5c7fbdc9501e4cfdf65/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-25_at_15_27_37.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5aa37721f634cba56d41dd98189b07fd/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-25_at_15_26_47_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/98c3ea6218b1ad264bd99eddee3b8e84/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-25_at_15_26_47.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cfc6a9b158afee991fb3b1b1b789add4/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-25_at_15_26_46.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"事主被尾隨上樓打劫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/651a9cd1c694d05092be4aa20cfe4d5b/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-25_at_15_26_45_1_.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T21:27:11.918238+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":286,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T10:18:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T22:50:34.321786+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T21:20:46.796481+00:00","content_hash":"a219bd3920749faccc048da89df2992ddf947c21cdf9b102d16522921201dc10","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}